WEBVTT

00:00:27.328 --> 00:00:30.718
and he let it alone for six generations.

00:00:30.718 --> 00:00:32.807
But then he created a second group

00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:35.315
of the individually
most productive chickens --

00:00:35.315 --> 00:00:38.270
you could call them superchickens --

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.377
and he put them together in a superflock,

00:00:40.377 --> 00:00:45.075
and each generation, he selected
only the most productive for breeding.

00:00:45.415 --> 00:00:47.969
After six generations had passed,

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:49.717
what did he find?

00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:53.548
Well, the first group, the average group,
was doing just fine.

00:00:53.548 --> 00:00:56.074
They were all plump and fully feathered

00:00:56.074 --> 00:00:58.352
and egg production
had increased dramatically.

00:00:58.702 --> 00:01:00.559
What about the second group?